{"key": "b3d1b048be5746674c337de24ef94b01", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Sim, o Crediário permite parcelar em até 48 vezes no cartão de crédito, e as taxas de juros podem variar conforme o emissor do cartão [1]. Mas cada emissor define o limite de parcelas conforme suas políticas de crédito [4]. O emissor também aprova a transação na contratação [4].\n\nOs juros do cliente (portador do cartão) aparecem numa simulação na maquininha. Para fazê-la, insira o cartão, informe o valor e escolha crédito > crediário. Também dá para imprimir o comprovante da simulação [4].\n\nA taxa de desconto (MDR) para o lojista pode ser consultada no Aplicativo Getnet Brasil ou no Portal do cliente [1]. As passagens não trazem um percentual de juros específico para MEI, nem uma regra que dependa de Manaus.\n\nMISSING: taxa de juros do Crediário específica para MEI em Manaus", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghpTwAHyYV3jJkbq8uoV", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2294}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2294, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2311, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 318, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-04#0"}
{"key": "9f34a8ff9647d1ca69cedaea0bfbecfd", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "The sources don't say whether Getnet antecipação works for boleto, and they give no fee for any bank. They only cover card-sales advances in general.\n\n- You can advance your sales in the Getnet Brasil app, which has no additional fees [1].\n- Other ways to advance are Eventual advance through the Getnet Service Center, and advance on the POS terminal itself [4].\n- Antecipação Automática is a condition for the exemption on the \"Receba Conforme suas Vendas\" receiving plan. Getnet reviews each contract individually and may or may not grant it, because it is a credit approval process [2].\n- The sources do mention settlement to all banks approved by the 5 main card brands, but they give no per-bank advance fee [3].\n\nMISSING: whether antecipação applies to boleto, and the exact advance fee per bank", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011CghpTsjAyUVLFMLjSF9WW", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 2378}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2378, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2310, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 497, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 229}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-partial-03#0"}
